      "disclosures": [
        {
          "title": "the fight",
          "body": "Take Amesha: it heals you and keeps energy topped up. The one weakpoint is the engines on its back, so circle behind and shoot them, and dodge the gas trail. A fight runs about 5 to 15 minutes with a decent Archgun and 20-plus undergeared; stuck players should run earlier Archwing missions for mods first."
        },
        {
          "title": "skip the fight: Circuit week 7",
          "body": "With The Duviri Paradox done, pick Atlas in week 7 of the 12-week normal Circuit rotation. Tier 2 gives Neuroptics, tier 5 Chassis, tier 8 Systems and tier 10 the main blueprint, all guaranteed in one week. Rewards claim once per week and reset Monday 00:00 UTC."
